  "goodToKnow": "Der Dschungel is a jungle: im Dschungel, der Großstadtdschungel (urban jungle), der Paragrafendschungel (a jungle of regulations). German has no j sound as in English jam, so loanwords spell it dsch: Dschungel, Dschihad, Dschingis Khan. The TV reality show Ich bin ein Star – Holt mich hier raus! is popularly called das Dschungelcamp. It came from Hindi via English. The plural is the same."
